<h1>Software that uses or supports CELT</h1>
<h2>Applications</h2>

<dl class="appList">

	<dt><a href="http://www.ekiga.org/">Ekiga</a></dt>
	<dd>Ekiga is a VoIP and video conferencing application for GNOME</dd>

	<dt><a href="http://www.freeswitch.org/">FreeSWITCH</a></dt>
	<dd>FreeSWITCH is an open source telephony toolkit, ranging from softphone to softswitch</dd>

	<dt><a href="http://www.jackaudio.org/">jack-audio-connection-kit (netjack)</a></dt>
	<dd>JACK over a network</dd>

        <dt><a href="http://www.nexgenvoip.org/">NexGenVoIP</a></dt>
	<dd>A Next Generation Telephone System</dd>

	<dt><a href="http://virtualsoundexchange.net/node/21">Soundjack</a></dt>
	<dd>Network Music Performance (MNP) client application</dd>

</dl>

<h2>Frameworks/libraries</h2>

        <dt><a href="http://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/">GStreamer</a></dt>
	<dd>GStreamer is a library for constructing graphs of media-handling components</dd>

	<dt><a href="http://www.annodex.net/software/liboggz/html/">liboggz</a></dt>
	<dd>Easy to use Ogg support library</dd>

<h2>Other uses</h2>

<dl class="appList">

	<dt><a href="http://www.radiochnc.com/">Radio CHNC</a></dt>
	<dd>Studio link made by Jonathan Thibault from <a href="http://navigue.com">Navigue</a> </dd>
</dl>

